  ">02</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3\">AI Calls &amp; Qualifies</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Our AI makes natural-sounding calls, identifies decision makers, and scores interest level.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-teal-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-8 h-8 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-cyan-600\">03</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3\">Book Meetings</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Qualified leads are automatically routed to your sales team&#x27;s calendar. You close.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow text-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-teal-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone-forwarded w-8 h-8 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 6h8\"></path><path d=\"m18 2 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-cyan-600\">04</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3\">Live Transfers</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Hot leads get instantly connected to your team. AI detects buying signals and transfers the call in real-time.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-24 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Why It",
  "&#x27;s Better</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-6 h-6 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Book More Meetings Automatically</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">AI qualifies leads and books directly to your calendar—you just show up and close.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-cyan-50 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-6 h-6 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Respond to Every Lead Instantly</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">No more 5-minute delays. AI responds in seconds—when interest is at its peak.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-purple-50 rounded-2xl border border-purple-100\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Reduce Workload on Your Team</",
